Modifications
-------------
The data have been modified: fields are cropped to regional domains, derived
quantities are computed (precipitation accumulated over 3 h / 6 h windows from the
cumulative total precipitation, moisture-flux divergence, a working definition of
the west-Pacific subtropical-high edge), and the results are rendered as images.
These derived products are not produced, checked or endorsed by ECMWF.

